221:\caption{\textbf{Problem overview.} \textbf{(a)}~TSFM adapters use the same head for every window. \textbf{(b)}~The natural mixture-of-experts extension fails on instance-normalized TSFMs under unfreezing: entropy collapses ($0.000{\pm}0.000$) and the remaining experts receive no gradient. Same backbone, different heads.}
